---
description: Apply this when creating or editing any UI component, page, or style
globs: ["**/*.tsx", "**/*.css", "**/*.html", "**/*.js"]
---

Read DESIGN.md in the project root before writing any UI code.
Extract the YAML front matter tokens and apply them exactly.
Never hardcode color hex values — always reference the token names (via CSS variables that map to DESIGN.md).
Run `npx @google/design.md lint DESIGN.md` and fix all errors before finishing.
